#: ../../source/user_guide/mixer.rst:4 61753a1a70384cb788122f14215e6562
msgid "混音系统"
msgstr "Mixing system"

#: ../../source/user_guide/mixer.rst:6 64ad2379db8a4cc49827689570175889
msgid ""
":ref:`FmodAudioBusLayout<class_FmodAudioBusLayout>` 保存配置，:ref:`FmodServer<class_FmodServer>` "
"管理运行时总线和 DSP。将声音送到 ``Music``、``SFX`` 或 ``Voice`` 后，可按类别调整音量、静音和效果。"
msgstr ""
":ref:`FmodAudioBusLayout<class_FmodAudioBusLayout>` stores configuration; "
":ref:`FmodServer<class_FmodServer>` manages runtime buses and DSPs. Route sounds to ``Music``, "
"``SFX``, or ``Voice`` to control their volume, mute state, and effects by category."

#: ../../source/user_guide/mixer.rst:9 52b9952f553444158e4251475b3df5c8
msgid "同步模式与独立模式"
msgstr "Synchronized and independent modes"

#: ../../source/user_guide/mixer.rst:14 8bf85104314c4b52a0486b0da418024c
msgid "项目设置"
msgstr "Project setting"

#: ../../source/user_guide/mixer.rst:15 ae46ac1545984adea05b9fd7528f6263
msgid "默认值"
msgstr "Default"

#: ../../source/user_guide/mixer.rst:16 7721898a3ae64ed7ba78eb4a50f30722
msgid "作用"
msgstr "Purpose"

#: ../../source/user_guide/mixer.rst:17 2c7db5463cb7478c9374320b9f60e67e
msgid "``audio/fmod/sync_godot_audio_buses``"
msgstr "``audio/fmod/sync_godot_audio_buses``"

#: ../../source/user_guide/mixer.rst:18 c67757d81a8c47caaac4932b93c442bd
msgid "``true``"
msgstr "``true``"

#: ../../source/user_guide/mixer.rst:19 bc99eab570fd44f2aaf4c6709ae5b19c
msgid "从 Godot AudioServer 同步总线与支持的效果器"
msgstr "Synchronize buses and supported effects from Godot AudioServer"

#: ../../source/user_guide/mixer.rst:20 77fdf21f879b4060a3f9b257ce7c3407
msgid "``audio/fmod/default_bus_layout``"
msgstr "``audio/fmod/default_bus_layout``"

#: ../../source/user_guide/mixer.rst:21 888ea0ff7cc54d50a2ac39a1d3e7ac44
msgid "``res://default_fmod_bus_layout.tres``"
msgstr "``res://default_fmod_bus_layout.tres``"

#: ../../source/user_guide/mixer.rst:22 dca92b28711e4faba39b405478bf7a30
msgid "独立模式的启动布局"
msgstr "Startup layout for independent mode"

#: ../../source/user_guide/mixer.rst:24 b780c453e8504fc982f36cf86560ed61
msgid ""
"修改同步开关后重新加载项目。同步模式通过原生 Audio 面板编辑，FMOD Audio 面板显示提示和原生面板入口。独立模式通过 FMOD Audio 面板或布局 API "
"编辑，下文代码使用独立模式。"
msgstr ""
"Reload the project after changing synchronization. Edit synchronized buses in the native Audio "
"panel; FMOD Audio shows a hint and an entry to that panel. Edit independent layouts in FMOD Audio"
" or through the layout API. The code below uses independent mode."

#: ../../source/user_guide/mixer.rst:27 f9288033dd39456ebd2706564030e04a
msgid "编辑器面板与保存"
msgstr "Editor panel and saving"

#: ../../source/user_guide/mixer.rst:29 16d7cb2c7eb149d6bec5d2eecac76f05
msgid "FMOD Audio 默认位于编辑器底栏，可浮动并恢复布局。音量推子、效果器勾选、拖放、右键菜单和撤销重做沿用原生 Audio 的操作；按住 Ctrl 拖动音量使用整数分贝步进。"
msgstr ""
"FMOD Audio opens in the editor bottom bar, supports floating, and restores its layout. Volume "
"faders, effect checkboxes, drag and drop, context menus, and undo/redo follow native Audio "
"behavior. Hold Ctrl while dragging volume for whole-decibel steps."

#: ../../source/user_guide/mixer.rst:31 e36e3a7effeb4e75ab0d1c35c279d306
msgid "**Add Bus** 添加总线；**Create** 创建并保存新布局。"
msgstr "**Add Bus** adds a bus; **Create** creates and saves a new layout."

#: ../../source/user_guide/mixer.rst:32 17a555693f8343a0a837e5282bb2468c
msgid "**Load** 打开布局，**Save As** 另存，**Load Default** 加载项目默认布局。"
msgstr ""
"**Load** opens a layout, **Save As** saves another copy, and **Load Default** opens the project "
"default."

#: ../../source/user_guide/mixer.rst:33 bec7e332668d41119e22857ecd2dd030
msgid "**FMOD > Set as Default** 将当前布局设为项目默认值。"
msgstr "**FMOD > Set as Default** makes the current layout the project default."

#: ../../source/user_guide/mixer.rst:34 9eed574471154c0594533de64be49652
msgid "**FMOD > Create FMOD Layout from Godot** 转换并保存独立布局，同时列出跳过的效果器。"
msgstr ""
"**FMOD > Create FMOD Layout from Godot** converts and saves an independent layout and reports "
"skipped effects."

#: ../../source/user_guide/mixer.rst:36 d4dd85b09516430ba70d7b5e5a17259d
msgid ""
"编辑器修改在 0.8 秒后合并保存，失败时保留未保存状态。打开其他布局不会更换项目默认值。默认引用保存为 UID，导出插件会包含默认布局及其依赖。默认文件缺失时先使用内存 "
"Master，首次编辑保存时创建文件；损坏文件会显示错误并阻止自动覆盖。"
msgstr ""
"Editor changes are saved after a 0.8-second debounce; failed saves retain the unsaved state. "
"Opening another layout keeps the project default. The default reference uses a UID, and the "
"export plugin includes the layout and its dependencies. A missing default starts with an in-"
"memory Master and is created on the first authoring save. A damaged default reports an error and "
"blocks automatic overwrite."

#: ../../source/user_guide/mixer.rst:39 f93cc42b8fa54ddd96f097d0a87488c8
msgid "总线 ID 与发送路由"
msgstr "Bus IDs and send routing"

#: ../../source/user_guide/mixer.rst:41 753681f72aeb49d3857bc7c5a1cc696c
msgid "Master 的稳定 ID 为 ``0``，始终位于首项。其他名称必须唯一、非空且不含逗号。ID 与显示索引分别管理，排序和改名会保留运行实例。"
msgstr ""
"Master has stable ID ``0`` and always stays first. Other names must be unique, nonblank, and "
"contain no commas. IDs are distinct from display indices; sorting and renaming preserve runtime "
"instances."

#: ../../source/user_guide/mixer.rst:43 38a7f26113714f35b39d949ae3ac6f70
msgid ""
"func create_sfx_route() -> void:\n"
"    var layout: FmodAudioBusLayout = FmodServer.get_audio_bus_layout()\n"
"    var sfx_id: int = layout.find_bus_id(&\"SFX\")\n"
"    if sfx_id == -1:\n"
"        sfx_id = layout.add_bus(&\"SFX\")\n"
"    if layout.find_bus_id(&\"Footsteps\") == -1:\n"
"        layout.add_bus(&\"Footsteps\", sfx_id)\n"
"    layout.set_bus_volume_db(sfx_id, -6.0)"
msgstr ""
"func create_sfx_route() -> void:\n"
"    var layout: FmodAudioBusLayout = FmodServer.get_audio_bus_layout()\n"
"    var sfx_id: int = layout.find_bus_id(&\"SFX\")\n"
"    if sfx_id == -1:\n"
"        sfx_id = layout.add_bus(&\"SFX\")\n"
"    if layout.find_bus_id(&\"Footsteps\") == -1:\n"
"        layout.add_bus(&\"Footsteps\", sfx_id)\n"
"    layout.set_bus_volume_db(sfx_id, -6.0)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/mixer.rst:54 ab13ea18efd24322ac74773da4773452
msgid "``set_bus_send()`` 可发送到任意无环目标，拒绝自身发送；``move_bus()`` 只改变显示顺序。删除总线时，进入该总线的其他总线和播放通道转接到原发送目标。"
msgstr ""
"``set_bus_send()`` accepts any acyclic destination and rejects self-sends. ``move_bus()`` changes"
" display order only. Deleting a bus redirects its incoming buses and playback channels to its "
"previous send target."

#: ../../source/user_guide/mixer.rst:56 d9f198afcc4d4920a684de2aee069883
msgid "播放器的 ``bus`` 属性保存名称，选项来自当前布局。重命名总线后需同步更新播放器；未知名称在下次播放时回退到 Master，修改属性不会重新路由已有通道。"
msgstr ""
"Players store names in ``bus``, with options supplied by the current layout. Update players after"
" renaming a bus. Unknown names fall back to Master on the next playback; changing the property "
"does not reroute an existing channel."

#: ../../source/user_guide/mixer.rst:59 be2ed797ef694884891ea83f51d27260
msgid "音量、Mute 与 Solo"
msgstr "Volume, Mute, and Solo"

#: ../../source/user_guide/mixer.rst:61 d46f897dd4dc4eec9c559c039aaaaa56
msgid ""
"通过 ``set_bus_volume_db()``、``set_bus_mute()`` 和 ``set_bus_solo()`` 修改配置。音量使用分贝，``0.0`` 为单位增益。Solo"
" 保留选中总线及其到 Master 的发送路径可听；退出 Solo 后恢复应用保存的 Mute 标记。"
msgstr ""
"Edit configuration with ``set_bus_volume_db()``, ``set_bus_mute()``, and ``set_bus_solo()``. "
"Volume is in decibels; ``0.0`` is unity gain. Solo keeps selected buses and their send paths to "
"Master audible. Disabling Solo reapplies the stored Mute flags."

#: ../../source/user_guide/mixer.rst:64 c763dd928ec647bbbea0af27112dde22
msgid "效果器槽位"
msgstr "Effect slots"

#: ../../source/user_guide/mixer.rst:66 3deee641102342fe928603b64071e7e5
msgid ""
"``add_bus_effect()`` 返回稳定槽位 ID。共享配置的槽位各有独立运行实例，参数修改更新现有 "
"DSP，排序和跨总线移动保留其状态。``set_bus_effect_enabled()`` 控制单个槽位，``set_bus_bypass()`` 控制整条总线的受管效果。"
msgstr ""
"``add_bus_effect()`` returns a stable slot ID. Slots sharing configuration have independent "
"runtime instances. Parameter edits update existing DSPs, and reordering or moving slots across "
"buses preserves their state. ``set_bus_effect_enabled()`` controls one slot; ``set_bus_bypass()``"
" controls managed effects across a bus."

#: ../../source/user_guide/mixer.rst:68 b0e25dfa69a041bd9eade59711191e0f
msgid ""
"``get_bus_effect()`` 返回配置资源。Capture、SpectrumAnalyzer 和 Record 的实时数据通过 "
"``FmodServer.get_bus_effect_instance()`` 读取，示例见 :doc:`dsp_effects`。"
msgstr ""
"``get_bus_effect()`` returns configuration. Read live Capture, SpectrumAnalyzer, and Record data "
"through ``FmodServer.get_bus_effect_instance()``; see :doc:`dsp_effects` for examples."

#: ../../source/user_guide/mixer.rst:71 ccb8cb834bf8401f9e1503f736aa97f8
msgid "切换布局与运行时对象"
msgstr "Switch layouts and access runtime objects"

#: ../../source/user_guide/mixer.rst:73 39939081e07c43d0863bc8e26bf956f7
msgid ""
"func activate_layout(path: String) -> Error:\n"
"    var layout: FmodAudioBusLayout = load(path) as FmodAudioBusLayout\n"
"    if layout == null:\n"
"        return ERR_INVALID_DATA\n"
"    return FmodServer.set_audio_bus_layout(layout)"
msgstr ""
"func activate_layout(path: String) -> Error:\n"
"    var layout: FmodAudioBusLayout = load(path) as FmodAudioBusLayout\n"
"    if layout == null:\n"
"        return ERR_INVALID_DATA\n"
"    return FmodServer.set_audio_bus_layout(layout)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/mixer.rst:81 25041ef0907f4c5e86d08ce4383bb259
msgid ""
"``set_audio_bus_layout()`` 先验证并创建新实例，成功后替换当前布局；失败时保留原布局，同步模式返回 ``ERR_BUSY``。播放通道移到同名总线，找不到时移到 "
"Master。运行时修改写入文件需单独调用 ``ResourceSaver.save()``。"
msgstr ""
"``set_audio_bus_layout()`` validates and creates new instances before replacing the current "
"layout. Failure preserves the old layout; synchronization mode returns ``ERR_BUSY``. Playing "
"channels move to matching bus names or Master. Save runtime changes explicitly with "
"``ResourceSaver.save()``."

#: ../../source/user_guide/mixer.rst:83 a594a37eafc54743bfd4153cd414d249
msgid ""
"布局修改在下一次服务器更新时应用，``flush_bus_updates()`` 可立即应用。通过 ``get_audio_bus()`` 或 ``get_audio_bus_by_id()``"
" 获取运行时总线。直接修改运行对象不会写回配置；服务器管理其释放。"
msgstr ""
"Layout changes apply on the next server update; ``flush_bus_updates()`` applies them immediately."
" Use ``get_audio_bus()`` or ``get_audio_bus_by_id()`` for runtime buses. Direct runtime edits do "
"not write back to configuration; the server manages their release."

#: ../../source/user_guide/mixer.rst:86 aecec657b7ee485bafc210513b6baf73
msgid "编辑器电平"
msgstr "Editor meters"

#: ../../source/user_guide/mixer.rst:88 98471f0cf3cf468280a31682cd766948
msgid ""
"独立模式下，面板显示检查器试听与编辑器内播放的电平，沿用编辑器 Audio Buses 的颜色和 tint。峰值保持 1.5 秒后以每秒 60 像素回落，电平条以每秒 60 dB 回落。界面最多"
" 30 Hz 刷新，隐藏后停止轮询。独立游戏进程的电平暂未接入。"
msgstr ""
"In independent mode, meters show inspector audition and editor playback using the editor Audio "
"Buses colors and tint. Peaks hold for 1.5 seconds, then fall at 60 pixels per second; level bars "
"fall at 60 dB per second. Presentation updates at up to 30 Hz and stops polling when hidden. "
"Meters from a separate game process are not yet connected."
